 amongst 7 year old school entrants</article-title><source>Eur J Pediatr</source><year>1990</year><volume>149</volume><fpage>434</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2332015</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Foxman</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Valdez</surname><given-names>RB</given-names></name><name><surname>Brook</surname><given-names>RH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Childhood enuresis: Prevalence, perceived impacts and prescribed treatments</article-title><source>Pediatrics</source><year>1986</year><volume>77</volume><fpage>482</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3960617</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT10"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Serel</surname><given-names>TA</given-names></name><name><surname>Akhan</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Koyuncuoglu</surname><given-names>HR</given-names></name><name><surname>Ozt&#x000fc;rk</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Do&#x0011f;ruer</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Unal</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Epidemiology of enuresis in Turkish children</article-title><source>Scand J Urol Nephrol</source><year>1997</year><volume>31</volume><fpage>537</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9458511</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="CIT11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chang</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsai</surname><given-names>WY</given-names></name><name><surname>Chiu</surname><given-names>YN</given-names